  "body": "When I looked up something about [datalist](https://html.spec.whatwg.org/multipage/form-elements.html#the-datalist-element) I was surprised by the binary of the example. I know this generates a textbox with the datalist options as suggestions. But felt it unpleasant nonetheless.\r\n\r\n```\r\n<label>\r\n Sex:\r\n <input name=sex list=sexes>\r\n <datalist id=sexes>\r\n  <option value=\"Female\">\r\n  <option value=\"Male\">\r\n </datalist>\r\n</label>\r\n```\r\n\r\nCan this be changed to something else? Maybe, eh, astronomical objects?\r\n```\r\n<label>\r\n Favourite astronomical object:\r\n <input name=objects list=object-suggestions>\r\n <datalist id=object-suggestions>\r\n  <option value=\"Earth\">\r\n  <option value=\"Pluto\">\r\n  <option value=\"The Moon\">\r\n </datalist>\r\n</label>\r\n```\r\n\r\nThe same goes for the second example.",
